<title>USA: Del Global Q1 Nov 2 full results.</title>
<headline>Del Global Q1 Nov 2 full results.</headline>
<dateline>VALHALLA, NY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					   Nov 2,	 Oct 28,</p>
<p>					    1996	    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			$12,311,000   $ 7,471,000</p>
<p>Costs and expenses</p>
<p> Cost of sales		    7,506,000     4,190,000</p>
<p> Research and development     1,077,000	 643,000</p>
<p>Selling, general &amp;</p>
<p>  administrative		  2,325,000     1,572,000</p>
<p>Interest (income) or</p>
<p>  expense - net		    (19,000)	 309,000</p>
<p> Total			     10,889,000     6,714,000</p>
<p>Income before provision</p>
<p>  for income taxes		1,422,000	 757,000</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes     434,000	 227,000</p>
<p> Net income			   988,000	 530,000</p>
<p>Per share amounts (a):</p>
<p>Net income per common share and common share equivalents,</p>
<p>on a primary and fully</p>
<p>  diluted basis			   .12	     .10</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common shares outstanding</p>
<p>and common share</p>
<p>  equivalents (a)		 8,463,327     5,546,650</p>
<p>Note: (a) Adjusted for the three percent stock dividend declared November 19, 1996 payable on December 23, 1996 to stockholders of record as of December 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Del Global Technologies Corp.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
